---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section class="section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <SectionHeading
      id="about-heading"
      index="01"
      title="About"
      subtitle="Career progression and engineering principles"
    />
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p>
          I started working in web development in 2017 and gradually focused on backend systems and the engineering decisions
          behind them. Today, I work across implementation, technical planning, and team support.
        </p>
        <p>
          I aim to make technical decisions clear and keep codebases maintainable.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-principles" aria-label="Working principles">
        <article>
          <span class="principle-index mono">01</span>
          <h3>Clarity</h3>
          <p>Make technical decisions and trade-offs easy to understand.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span class="principle-index mono">02</span>
          <h3>Ownership</h3>
          <p>Take responsibility from planning through delivery and maintenance.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span class="principle-index mono">03</span>
          <h3>Maintainability</h3>
          <p>Build software that remains easy to change and support.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
